# EarlyProof — credential checklist (PLACEHOLDERS ONLY — never put real values in this file)
#
# EarlyProof does not read secrets from environment variables or from any
# file in this repo. Every credential below is entered by the founder in the
# app's own settings UI at runtime, is stored server-side in the app's
# database, and is never returned to the client. This file exists so a
# developer reviewing or forking the code can see exactly which credentials
# the app uses and where each one goes. If you adapt the app to a different
# host, supply these through that host's secret store — do not commit them.

# ── Step 2 (REQUIRED): Muse LLM ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Entered in: AI settings tab. Without this, the core flow is blocked
# server-side (search, classification, drafts, summaries) — no fallback.
CLAUDE_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxx
CLAUDE_SMALL_MODEL=your-small-fast-claude-model-name
CLAUDE_LARGE_MODEL=your-large-claude-model-name

# ── Bluesky (optional, Channels tab) ──────────────────────────────────────
# A free Bluesky account + app password (Settings → App Passwords in
# Bluesky). Used to search posts and post founder-approved replies. The app
# password itself is not stored; only the session tokens from login are.
BLUESKY_HANDLE=you.bsky.social
BLUESKY_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx

# ── GitHub (optional, Channels tab) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Fine-grained personal access token from your own GitHub account. Only
# needed to post approved issue comments; search works without it.
GITHUB_PAT=github_pat_xxxxxxxxxxxx

# ── Reddit POC (optional, Channels tab) ───────────────────────────────────
# Your own Reddit app credentials (https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps).
# Either the "script" flow (client ID + secret + your Reddit username and
# password) or the OAuth "installed app" flow (client ID + secret + code).
# Internal proof of concept only: Reddit's free non-commercial terms do not
# cover commercial use.
REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=xxxxxxxxxxxx
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=xxxxxxxxxxxx
REDDIT_USERNAME=your-reddit-username
REDDIT_PASSWORD=xxxxxxxxxxxx

# ── PostHog (optional, per profile) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Your own PostHog project: host, project ID, and a personal API key with
# read access. Used only to import usage events for your tagged seed users.
POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.posthog.com
POSTHOG_PROJECT_ID=00000
POSTHOG_API_KEY=phx_xxxxxxxxxxxx
